example:
Java 应用接入：starter、注解；线上 QPS 推 Nacos：

```xml
<dependency>
  <groupId>com.alibaba.cloud</groupId>
  <artifactId>spring-cloud-starter-alibaba-sentinel</artifactId>
</dependency>
```

```java
@Service
public class OrderService {
  @SentinelResource("order.place")
  public Order place(Cmd cmd) { /* 须经 Spring 代理进入 */ }
}
```

```yaml
# 实际项目：按应用拉规则（勿只靠 FlowRuleManager.loadRules）
spring.application.name: order-service
spring.cloud.sentinel.datasource.ds1.nacos.server-addr: 127.0.0.1:8848
spring.cloud.sentinel.datasource.ds1.nacos.data-id: ${spring.application.name}-flow-rules
spring.cloud.sentinel.datasource.ds1.nacos.group-id: DEFAULT_GROUP
spring.cloud.sentinel.datasource.ds1.nacos.data-type: json
spring.cloud.sentinel.datasource.ds1.nacos.rule-type: flow
```

```json
[
  {"resource":"order.place","grade":1,"count":20,"limitApp":"default"},
  {"resource":"order.cancel","grade":1,"count":5,"limitApp":"default"},
  {"resource":"POST:/orders","grade":1,"count":50,"limitApp":"default"}
]
```

```java
// 仅本地冒烟；线上用上面 Nacos 数组，一资源一条
FlowRule rule = new FlowRule("order.place");
rule.setGrade(RuleConstant.FLOW_GRADE_QPS);
rule.setCount(1);
FlowRuleManager.loadRules(Collections.singletonList(rule));
```

deep.body:
加 starter 后打一条 HTTP，在控制台或日志里确认出现 URL 资源。再给 Service 方法加注解，并配一条 QPS 为 1 的流控：

```java
@Service
public class OrderService {
  @SentinelResource("order.place")
  public Order place(Cmd cmd) { /* 业务 */ }

  public Order placeViaThis(Cmd cmd) {
    return this.place(cmd); // 同类 this：注解不生效，不会被拦
  }
}

// 仅本地冒烟：正式环境不要靠这段写死规则
FlowRule rule = new FlowRule("order.place");
rule.setGrade(RuleConstant.FLOW_GRADE_QPS);
rule.setCount(1);
FlowRuleManager.loadRules(Collections.singletonList(rule));
```

经 Spring 注入调用 `place`：同一秒第二次应被拦。调用 `placeViaThis`：不应被拦。

一条流控只绑一个〔资源名｜@SentinelResource 的 value，或 Web 适配登记的 URL〕。不同业务方法用不同资源名，在同一份 Nacos JSON 数组里各写一条，互不影响。

```java
@SentinelResource("order.place")
public Order place(Cmd cmd) { ... }

@SentinelResource("order.cancel")
public void cancel(String orderId) { ... }
```

```json
[
  {"resource":"order.place","grade":1,"count":20,"limitApp":"default"},
  {"resource":"order.cancel","grade":1,"count":5,"limitApp":"default"},
  {"resource":"POST:/orders","grade":1,"count":50,"limitApp":"default"}
]
```

下单 20 QPS、取消 5 QPS、入口 URL 50 QPS 可以并存。不要多个方法共用一个资源名却指望分开计数。热点商品再按参数配，见 intro 里的热点规则，不是再抄一条同名流控就能代替。
